{"3329050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Velhodium Isle", "steam_appid": 3329050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An archipelago of islands from which no one has ever returned...</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329050/extras/9e9218fdd897bd45b165a917ab48497f.poster.avif?t=1781306037\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329050/extras/9e9218fdd897bd45b165a917ab48497f.webm?t=1781306037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329050/extras/9e9218fdd897bd45b165a917ab48497f.mp4?t=1781306037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to plunge into a world of chaos, where scientific experiments have gone wrong and reality has been torn to shreds. Crowds of bloodthirsty zombies, flying gremlins, giant monsters - all this has become commonplace on islands that were once prosperous regions. After a catastrophe that remains a mystery, the cities have fallen and the inhabitants have become a sheer terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your task is simple but deadly</strong>: collect spells, buy powerful weapons, and destroy enemies while exploring a variety of locations, from gothic castles to abandoned laboratories. Disable the five defense towers that create a barrier to reach the main island. Then head to the epicenter of the anomaly and destroy it while battling an army of monsters and their giant leaders.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Velhodium Isle offers 5 huge regions, each with its own unique themes and locations. Here you will find:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329050/extras/9f38b7019d4c2a0a6c0b4fa264431b03.poster.avif?t=1781306037\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329050/extras/9f38b7019d4c2a0a6c0b4fa264431b03.webm?t=1781306037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329050/extras/9f38b7019d4c2a0a6c0b4fa264431b03.mp4?t=1781306037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medieval castles with knights and animated trees.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Egyptian pyramids with mysterious robots inside.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snowy wastelands and frozen ports hiding dangerous creatures.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Urban post-apocalyptic zones ravaged in chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fantasy worlds filled with ghosts, demons and unexpected enemies.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A huge variety of gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your path to victory</strong>. You won't be able to complain about the difficulty - this is a game where you choose your own playthrough style.<br><br>Exciting retro shooter atmosphere with modern improvements:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully immersive lighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed locations that take you to a variety of eras and places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Velhodium Isle is a unique combination of classic retro boomer shooters with elements of modern gameplay design. Grab your weapons, prepare for chaos and prove that you can survive where no one else has.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will you be able to correct the mistakes of scientists and save the world?</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared