dern gameplay design. Grab your weapons, prepare for chaos and prove that you can survive where no one else has.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will you be able to correct the mistakes of scientists and save the world?</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329050/extras/5857a6dbdefca8efa59cbb03fcf179a1.poster.avif?t=1781306037\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329050/extras/5857a6dbdefca8efa59cbb03fcf179a1.webm?t=1781306037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329050/extras/5857a6dbdefca8efa59cbb03fcf179a1.mp4?t=1781306037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>", "short_description": "Velhodium Isle is a pixel-art boomer shooter in which you fight monsters in themed locations. Use weapons and magic to get through crowds of monsters and close the source of apocalyptic terrors. Disable shields, close the anomaly, and survive the brutal slaughter!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329050/8faa3ea5596bf37e30fda4a4c2e3ec1d55cd7f6d/header.jpg?t=1781306037", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329050/3b3630b6140e13a2f0abf4378764076fd2c66fe1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781306037", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329050/3b3630b6140e13a2f0abf4378764076fd2c66fe1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781306037", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> X64 architecture<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 780M<br></li><li><str